### Code Investigation Commands
# Checked if current code uses OSC messages
grep -r "osc|OSC" src/grid.rs
grep -r "serialosc" src/grid.rs
ls src/
cat src/lib.rs

### Key Discovery
# Current code IS using OSC messages via grid_osc.rs module
# - grid_osc.rs: OSC-based manager (DEFAULT, uses serialosc)
# - grid.rs: Serial-based manager (legacy/fallback)
# This explains why newer grid works well - it's using proper OSC communication

### File Operations
rm src/grid.rs
# Deleted legacy serial-based grid manager, keeping only OSC-based implementation